Package: piknit
Title: Embed the Pi Coding Agent in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure", email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Embed the Pi coding agent in R. Drive a live agent from R with a
    small scripting API - one turn with 'pi_run()', a multi-turn session that
    keeps its memory with 'pi_session()' - or drop it straight into R Markdown
    and Quarto through custom knitr engines that run a live agent (and
    fail-loud command-line tools) at render time, weaving the agent's real
    replies and tool output into the document. Rendering becomes an
    integration test: a stale claim or a broken command fails the build.
    Inspired by the leanknit and duckknit literate-engine packages.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
